  "description": "This is a personality test game where you simply choose, by instinct, what the illustration looks like to you,\nand discover insights into your hidden psychology.\n\nDoes this picture look like a bicycle? Binoculars? Or something else…!?\n\nDepending on the option you choose, the game reveals what you value most,\nthe worries you may be carrying, and how others see you—\neven personality traits you might not be aware of yourself.\n\nEach result also comes with a bit of advice,\nmaking it perfect not only for enjoying alone and getting to know yourself better,\nbut also for having fun in a group or as part of a streamer’s live commentary.\n\n\nThe game supports both button controls and touch controls, allowing you to play in TV mode, handheld mode, or tabletop mode.\n※This game is designed to be played on the Nintendo Switch™ in vertical orientation.",
